{"id":"431912","name":"海味南瓜汤","author":"零零落落2011","authorId":"7024043","desc":"","cover":"images/431912/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小南瓜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"10g"},{"name":"海米","amount":"10g"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"老姜","amount":"3片"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备好食材：南瓜、虾皮、海米、老姜洗净；","img":"images/431912/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"南瓜去蒂，切块；","img":"images/431912/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"不粘炒锅倒入适量玉米油烧热；","img":"images/431912/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入南瓜，快速翻炒；","img":"images/431912/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入清水；放入虾皮、海米、姜片；","img":"images/431912/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上盖子，大火烧开；","img":"images/431912/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"调入盐，搅拌均匀；","img":"images/431912/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"食材煮熟后，关火；","img":"images/431912/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"【海味南瓜汤】做好啦。","img":"images/431912/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"调料可根据个人口味调整。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}